      "source": "pkhex:Saves/MemoryCard/SAV3GCMemoryCard.cs and pkhex:Saves/Util/SaveHandlerGCI.cs and pkhex:Saves/SAV3XD.cs",
      "note": "XD lists where each of its sub-blocks starts at 0x0040, and PKHeX reads them from there. The checks hold the sub-blocks this layout reads to the offsets it uses, from PKHeX's blank XD save. The Japanese release, GXXJ, has a shorter shadow table, so its offsets differ."
